  "published": "2026-07-11T14:18:33.257Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 — Request/reply RPC client (IKafkaRpcClient); typed producer (IKafkaProducer.SendAsync) + producer-only registration (AddIrkallaKafkaProducer, no GroupId); idempotent producer on by default (EnableIdempotence); optional consumer-side deduplication (IMessageDeduplicator + message-id header); multi-assembly scanning (ServiceAssemblies); per-service consumer groups ([KafkaService(GroupId=...)]); appsettings/IConfiguration binding + IOptions; consumer health check (IrkallaKafkaHealthCheck); net8.0/net10.0 multi-target; DLQ stack trace opt-in (IncludeStackTraceInDlq, default off); Confluent.Kafka 2.15.0. 0.1.2 — Consistent telemetry activity name (irkalla.kafka.consume). 0.1.1 — Package icon, README, SourceLink and symbols. 0.1.0 — First public release: attribute-based services, header routing, JSON/Avro/Protobuf handlers, ErrorPolicy (Skip/Dlq/Stop) with clamped exponential retry, ConsumerMode.Single/Auto (auto-scaling consumers per topic), first-class SSL/SASL options plus raw librdkafka passthrough, OpenTelemetry ActivitySource + metrics. Fully tested.",
